  "statement": "I appreciate the consensus on merging RES-01 and TRU-03, as it enhances both security and compliance. I also support the modification of RES-05 to align with EFF-05 for efficiency in overdue notifications. However, I emphasize that GRN-01 is critical for energy-efficient operations and should not be compromised for performance. I propose modifying GRN-01 to specify that energy-efficient solutions can coexist with performance requirements, ensuring both sustainability and functionality. This way, we can achieve high performance without neglecting our environmental responsibilities.",
